OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions raised over cost of city
OL,4,Acentre planters
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has questioned whether
OL,7,Fspending #90,000 on new planters for
OL,8,FLeicester city centre represents value
OL,9,Ffor money.
OL,11,FLeicester City Council announced on 8
OL,12,FOctober it had partnered with BID
OL,13,FLeicester to install new street
OL,14,Ffurniture on three city centre roads.
OL,16,FThe scheme will see 10 planters placed
OL,17,Fon King Street and Market Street, with
OL,18,Fa further two planned for St Martins,
OL,19,Fcreating what the council said would be
OL,20,Fa more attractive route linking New
OL,21,FWalk and the Old Town.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
