OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions raised over cost of city
OL,4,Acentre planters
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour-run authority said the
OL,7,Fplanters would contain small trees,
OL,8,Fshrubs and drought-tolerant plants.
